{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mq75a81q","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/cloude","title":"[ingest] Judge metric-first when a spec is present, else rationale","summary":"When the problem carries a metric spec + measurements, judge METRIC-FIRST: improvement vs baseline, guardrail regressions (a near-veto), and gap to a researched competitor benchmark (confidence-weighted tiebreaker). Otherwise fall back to test pass/fail then rationale (simplest diff, fewest side effects, matches style). The judge weighs tradeoffs with judgment, NOT a fixed weighted-score formula.","created_by":"ingest","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-10T19:01:05.747Z"}
